/-!
# Pose root of `Prism.TriangularPrism.polyhedron`

ν and one optimal pose of `Prism.TriangularPrism.polyhedron` (`fixtures/nieuwland/prism/triangular-prism`) as the one root of a system, downstream of the representatives' theorem `prismTriangularPrism_nu_reps_list` (a closed form). The weak fit at `ν` is the exact record's over the lift `ℤ[α]` (`rupert-lean-export lift-weak`), checked by the kernel (`weak_check`); the lift's points are the solid's `Dim` points (`points_eq`). The system `S` is `cfSystem` (`Modules/Pose/PoseCheck.lean`): `x 0 = ℓ`, `x 1 = α`, the pose's chart coordinates `x 2, …, x 9`, three helpers, `R₂ = matAt x 13`, `R₁ = matAt x 22`, `t = (x 31, x 32)`. Generated by `lean/scripts/poseroot.py`.
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Pose.PrismTriangularPrism

open Check PolynomialSystem

/-- The lift's root. -/
def root : Root :=
  ⟨[9, 0, -9, 0, 1], 0, 2,
    1, [9, 0, -9, 0, 1],
    16, 16, 19, 32, 7,
    13407807929942597099574024998205846127479365820592393377723561443721764030073546976801874298166903427690031858186486050853753882811946569946433649006084096,
    14352606134514973401617011701085904800856477022753528264798616495074127031453970180175253124899536567778469802936868615225397959519717305709683515822854724,
